    "Your desk status in big LED letters. Add it to StandBy and it's on show whenever iPhone Duo stands in tent mode. Tap it to switch status." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "用大号 LED 点阵字显示你的桌面状态。把它加到待机显示中，iPhone Duo 一立成帐篷模式就会显示。轻点可切换状态。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
